1. require a declared win’s `winnerSeat` to hold a legal winning hand;
2. require an exhaustive draw to have an empty wall;
3. replace the metadata-only win fixture with a real, fully accounted-for winning inventory;
4. add regressions for impossible win/draw outcomes;
5. reformat the compressed application source consistently without changing behavior; and
6. run the full test, syntax, and whitespace checks.

